  "content": {
    "title": "长春师范大学举办2024届毕业生春季双选会省内校友专场招聘会",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2024-04-15",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">长春师范大学</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:22.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">举办</span>2024届毕业生春季双选会省内校友专场招聘会</strong></span></span></span></strong></strong></span></span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 4</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">月</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">12</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">日，我校</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">2024</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">届毕业生春季双选会省内校友专场招聘会在教学综合楼二楼大厅举行。学校党委副书记、校长王延明，党委副书记刘国宁到现场指导，并与校友亲切交谈，了解校友企业的招聘需求，听取毕业生对学校、学院就业工作意见建议。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 本次双选会有</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">50</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">余家省内校友企业和校友推介企业参加，提供近千个岗位，涵盖教育、管理、科技、财会金融、传媒、旅游等多个行业领域。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 招聘会现场摩肩接踵，气氛热烈，秩序井然。吉林省世纪赢海科技有限公司、长春市朝阳区三智人才培训学校、通化海恩达高科技股份有限公司等用人单位的展位前人头攒动</span><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">……参会同学在招聘单位前查看信息，咨询情况，积极与招聘单位负责人交流，负责人向毕业生们详细讲解企业岗位需求、薪酬福利等相关内容。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 据悉，</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">月</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">27</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">日，就业工作指导处、校友工作办公室联合发出《长春师范大学</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">2024</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">届毕业生校友企业（省内专场）双选会邀请函》，旨在进一步沟通校友情感，凝聚校友力量，为毕业生提供多元化的就业平台，促进母校与校友共同发展。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 学校十分重视校友资源助力毕业生留吉就业创业，以</span><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">“朋辈引航 共话成长”系列活动为载体，邀请在吉就业创业优秀校友回校开展专场报告会、经验交流会，为母校学生开展职业生涯规划与就业指导，促进毕业生充分高质量就业。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n                    ",
